    "text_full": "Thursday, May 21, 2026\nTRENDING\nSalman Khan News Today: Why the Bollywood Superstar Is Trending All Over Social Media!‘Michael’ Best Scenes: Jaafar Jackson Channels the ‘King of Pop’ Perfectly in Blockbuster Michael Jackson BiopicMouni Roy Brings Desi Royalty to Cannes 2026 in a Stunning Gujarati Patola Gown, See Pics‘Khatron Ke Khiladi 15’ Contestants Fees: Who Is Likely the Highest Paid Contestant on Rohit Shetty’s Show?Seema Singh’s Cannes 2026 Appearance With Son Shrey Singh Is All About Grace, Glamour and Indian CultureAfter ‘Mortal Kombat II’, Get ‘Mortal Kombat 3’ Update: From Storyline to Cast, All You Need to Know'Dragon' Star Jr NTR Birthday: 5 Iconic Performances That Proved He is Tollywood’s True ‘Young Tiger’‘Off Campus’ Season 2 Release Date Announced? Everything To Know About the Returning Briar University SeriesJr NTR’s ‘Dragon’ Cast, Release Date and Plot Details: An Assassin, a Cop and a Deadly Showdown Await'India's Got Latent 2' Guest Rumours: Alia Bhatt, Sharvari on Samay Raina's Show? Leaked Image Goes ViralDaily Horoscope for May 20, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Scorpio, Aquarius, Aries and MoreJr NTR's Movie ‘Dragon’ Release Date: Prashanth Neel’s High-Octane Action Spectacle Unveils Powerful First GlimpseJacqueline Fernandez Turns Heads at Cannes 2026 Chopard Miracles Gala in Elegant Vintage-Inspired Black DressPreity Zinta’s Movie ‘Vibe’ Release Date: Actor Returns To Big Screen With Kunal Kemmu’s Action-Comedy After Long HiatusBox Office Collection Report (19 May 2026): ‘Karuppu’, ‘Pati Patni Aur Woh Do’, ‘Raja Shivaji’ And More, Which Film Is Winning The Audience?\nLifestyle\nWellness\nStyle\nWeddings\nHacks\nPAWSOME\nViral\nHome\nLifestyle\nStyle\nAditi Rao Hydari Cannes 2026 Looks: Actor Stuns in Regal Saree and Dramatic Red Carpet Gown at French Riviera\nAditi Rao Hydari Cannes 2026 Looks: Actor Stuns in Regal Saree and Dramatic Red Carpet Gown at French Riviera\nAditi Rao Hydari turned heads at Cannes 2026 with two stunning looks, a regal embellished saree by Jade and a dramatic Tony Ward gown featuring a thigh-high slit and elegant train.\nTeam BTMay 18, 2026, 14:20 IST\n\nAditi Rao Hydari returned to the prestigious Cannes Film Festival 2026 and stunned us with two gorgeous looks. Being closely associated with a cosmetic company, Aditi represented the same on the red carpet. We wonder if the actress plans to walk the red carpet for any of the reminder days but till then, we will decode two of her most recent looks from her time at the festival. After picking a traditional saree for her first appearance this year, Aditi gave a quick neon touch up to her red carpet outing. Let’s elaborate on these looks in detail.\n\nCannes 2026: Aditi Rao Hydari in Jade\n\nPicking an embellished saree by Jade, Aditi strutted in style, winning hearts at the French Riviera. If you love shades of gold in your saree cabinet, this is a piece you would want to invest in. Styled by Sanam Ratansi, Aditi’s look for the event was extremely traditional including the hairdo and the jewellery. She tied her hair in a pretty braid and picked a traditional choker to complement her attire. Coming to her makeup, she kept it dreamy. With hot pink lips, brushed eyebrows, curled eyelashes, kohled eyes and contoured cheeks, she kept it glamorous and oh-so-pretty!\n\nCannes 2026: Aditi Rao Hydari in Tony Ward\n\nFor her red-carpet walk, Aditi picked an ethereal Tony Ward gown. The one-off shoulder attire featured thigh-high slit and an elaborate train that added an extra dash of drama. With blushed cheeks, soft pink lips, winged eyeliner and hair styled in soft waves, she kept her look elegant.\n\nComing to her accessories, she perfectly complemented her stunning attire with a delicate diamond necklace.\n\nAditi Rao Hydari has become a regular presence at the film festival, consistently delivering looks that outdo her previous appearances each year. Here’s looking forward to what more she has in store for us.​\n\n\nTRENDING\n\nSalman Khan News Today: Why the Bollywood Superstar Is Trending All Over Social Media!\n\n‘Michael’ Best Scenes: Jaafar Jackson Channels the ‘King of Pop’ Perfectly in Blockbuster Michael Jackson Biopic\n\nMouni Roy Brings Desi Royalty to Cannes 2026 in a Stunning Gujarati Patola Gown, See Pics\n\n‘Khatron Ke Khiladi 15’ Contestants Fees: Who Is Likely the Highest Paid Contestant on Rohit Shetty’s Show?\n\nSeema Singh’s Cannes 2026 Appearance With Son Shrey Singh Is All About Grace, Glamour and Indian Culture\n\nAfter ‘Mortal Kombat II’, Get ‘Mortal Kombat 3’ Update: From Storyline to Cast, All You Need to Know\n\n'Dragon' Star Jr NTR Birthday: 5 Iconic Performances That Proved He is Tollywood’s True ‘Young Tiger’\n\n‘Off Campus’ Season 2 Release Date Announced? Everything To Know About the Returning Briar University Series\n\nJr NTR’s ‘Dragon’ Cast, Release Date and Plot Details: An Assassin, a Cop and a Deadly Showdown Await\n\n'India's Got Latent 2' Guest Rumours: Alia Bhatt, Sharvari on Samay Raina's Show? Leaked Image Goes Viral\n\nDaily Horoscope for May 20, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Scorpio, Aquarius, Aries and More\n\nJr NTR's Movie ‘Dragon’ Release Date: Prashanth Neel’s High-Octane Action Spectacle Unveils Powerful First Glimpse\n\nJacqueline Fernandez Turns Heads at Cannes 2026 Chopard Miracles Gala in Elegant Vintage-Inspired Black Dress\n\nPreity Zinta’s Movie ‘Vibe’ Release Date: Actor Returns To Big Screen With Kunal Kemmu’s Action-Comedy After Long Hiatus\n\nBox Office Collection Report (19 May 2026): ‘Karuppu’, ‘Pati Patni Aur Woh Do’, ‘Raja Shivaji’ And More, Which Film Is Winning The Audience?\n\nRelated Articles\nMouni Roy Brings Desi Royalty to Cannes 2026 in a Stunning Gujarati Patola Gown, See Pics\nSeema Singh’s Cannes 2026 Appearance With Son Shrey Singh Is All About Grace, Glamour and Indian Culture\nJacqueline Fernandez Turns Heads at Cannes 2026 Chopard Miracles Gala in 